    //   - For the reduction update, keep the loop order i (outer), k
    //     (middle), j (inner) so that we:
    //        * stream through k (the shared dimension) while
    //          reusing A(i,k) and B(k,*) in cache
    //        * keep j innermost and vectorized for C and B, which are
